# Suppressions for `trivy image` in the image-scan CI job.
#
# Every entry needs a CVE, a one-line reason it cannot be fixed, and an expiry
# date. An ignore file without justifications becomes the place findings go to
# die — if you cannot write the reason, fix the finding instead.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD  # reason
#
# Empty on purpose: as of 2026-08-04 the image scans clean at HIGH and CRITICAL.
